  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00c68ee4d7dceb346ba4f60d3f40e2cd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcID: Gurt_1
  npcName: Gurt
  dialogueLines:
  - Alright it seems like the Movers have moved all the things that's good.
  - "I will place these things somewhere\u2026."
  - Just when the player was going to start, a short well mannered person poofed
    in.
  - Gurt gurt gurt to you fellow Gentlemen.
  - 'Player was then dumbfounded and confused when someone poofed into his Apartment

'
  - Huh?!? Who are you???
  - 'How did you get inside my house? What are you????!?!?!?

'
  - Why dear child I am Gurt gurt gurble gurt!
  - "Wait\u2026 So you are a Conductor and your name is Mr.Conductor?\r\n"
  - I come from a long line of hard working Gurts and I will continue the lineage
    onwards!
  - Anyways dear child I am here to offer you guidance to where your precious treasure
    is!
  - The player then follows Gurt to a room of the apartment the screen fades and
    screen fades back in and both of them are in the kitchen.
  speakerNames:
  - Player
  - Player
  - ' '
  - Gurt
  - ' '
  - Player
  - Player
  - Gurt
  - Player
  - Gurt
  - Gurt
  - ' '
  hasChoices: 0
  choiceLineIndex: 2
  yesJumpToLine: 3
  yesEndLine: 4
  noJumpToLine: 5
  noEndLine: 6
  removeAfterDialogue: 1
